.SS "sc_array_t* p8est_mesh_t::quad_level"

.PP
Stores lists of per-level quads\&. The array has entries indexed by 0\&.\&.P4EST_QMAXLEVEL inclusive that are arrays of local quadrant ids\&. Is NULL if compute_level_lists in params is 0\&. 
